# An allowlist: the test image gets only what the tests and the install read. A denylist let a
# stray local folder (.codex-test-deps, unreadable by Docker) break the build, and would put the
# host's .env, .secrets or other leftovers into the image the next time one appeared.
*
!app
!alembic
!alembic.ini
!database
!scripts
!tests
!docs/design
!pyproject.toml
!requirements-lock.txt
!README.md
!start-local.sh
**/__pycache__
